00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Prickly Bang-b</b>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:28.230
Togemon.

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:30.190
Her attack is Prickly Bang-bang.

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:33.680
It uses prickly thorns to hit the 
opponent with a bang-bang attack.

00:22:33.680 --> 00:22:36.170
She's wearing boxing gloves!

00:22:36.170 --> 00:22:39.570
Her sandbag must be full of holes!

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:43.470
The seven Death Generals 
are attacking us!

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:45.840
